   ["The lamb is excellent.","L'agnello è eccellente.","47f95686-b1e2-4b48-83ae-5fb7e353f2ac","d954e8d1-4697-4b73-9868-f7499e472e1e"],
   ["It's been slow-cooked, with rosemary.","È stato cotto a lungo a fuoco lento, con il rosmarino.","4c7ee99d-d373-449b-af3b-8753c5c96d53","713cbe23-c9da-47eb-945b-67e320c70004"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S09": [
   ["I'll have the lamb, please.","Prendo l'agnello, per favore.","dc38313c-b001-41cb-95ef-67bdaa49b7c9","f7c87796-df2d-4790-ae3a-56e40112efdb"],
   ["With a side of greens.","Con un contorno di verdure.","bd3ce971-b135-4254-bf65-c876b6672b0b","1903f0ca-2e0b-49c2-b796-86f563ed8552"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S10": [
   ["And the risotto for me.","E per me il risotto.","0ab13c8c-60dc-46a1-a2e0-05939a8a206e","7bc44100-2d79-4641-ac9a-ee9be675ce17"],
   ["With a small green salad to start.","Con una piccola insalata verde per cominciare.","70fb684a-eed0-4494-ae67-5e3693ac68d1","0d09a184-f94c-4a5c-a7fb-70cf98d81cd5"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S11": [
   ["Of course.","Certo.","73e1ade0-040c-4d28-a285-138a727f1253","10ccbf59-6837-4f91-9467-8b1f0eed4a61"],
   ["And what would you like to drink?","E cosa desiderano da bere?","fda6d28c-2fff-436f-8ff7-2216faa48f38","3c330c6a-9b0f-42f2-a9aa-6db0ef2f8445"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S14": [
   ["Excellent choice.","Ottima scelta.","56d7746a-237a-49bc-be1e-f6452fbbb0e7","50c97263-362f-4af5-84e8-806fdd250a92"],
   ["I'll bring it right over.","Gliela porto subito.","9bc615d5-cc29-4f18-9644-108ef9da1f8d","2ee2a4f2-0fe9-430f-87ef-a30375545f07"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S15": [
   ["Is everything alright?","Va tutto bene?","23266310-e53f-4e74-bb89-2a6e5edda66b","fb55160f-0934-480e-ba93-37415d87e037"],
   ["Do you have any room for dessert?","Avete spazio per il dolce?","df370956-ad47-4c90-90e2-96f3720ad1b3","7790eefe-eddd-461e-b8e5-c1adcffa09fc"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S16": [
   ["Just two coffees, please.","Solo due caffè, per favore.","1b4795de-9cab-44ac-bf10-bdf2871e639c","5a36c503-ed03-440d-95bc-ccd29ef13bcc"],
   ["Decaf for me.","Per me decaffeinato.","c1dc2e72-fda3-49bd-8ea0-a1cf6d02e0ee","c9d78f55-bfa5-46d5-aff2-bf8f06ffb788"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC09-S17": [
   ["And the bill, when you're ready.","E il conto, quando può.","2e348068-1608-4110-be5b-fc7b194533dc","e8f79662-ae53-4b0c-8228-e5514f0969e7"],
   ["Could we split it?","Potremmo dividerlo?","7876bf13-7cb4-4435-a8c2-195200bded48","6d836c0c-caf6-4157-92f1-1db7452d5723"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S01": [
   ["Excuse me.","Mi scusi.","4d35ce53-4b8e-465f-b7a9-b95426abe3f8","f6d78500-d9bc-4a3b-9d9d-8e55df94d117"],
   ["Do you have any painkillers?","Avete degli antidolorifici?","ef9a5855-5c1c-410b-bdcf-ab14fb36c925","552d77f6-0536-4b5a-838c-29ecdc50ac35"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S03": [
   ["Thank you.","Grazie.","e8c75798-5ad0-47f4-926d-48a88505f3d8","73b1cf43-8f8c-4f06-ae8e-0f7cbe6c9a78"],
   ["And do you have any painkillers for children?","E avete degli antidolorifici per bambini?","92a7c00c-c8e9-447d-b822-048ead6c3a43","226f85ba-45ee-4585-ae3b-e3f28cef06a5"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S04": [
   ["I think so,","Penso di sì,","083c1b13-324a-46db-9451-ad584921519f","5c2bfe3b-78aa-4be3-a5c5-3ff7e37fce08"],
   ["but you'll have to look to make sure.","ma dovrà guardare per esserne sicuro.","82613111-5337-40a3-ab31-a9c5c8584196","f17295f4-a609-4789-b7ed-491618d61a8b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S05": [
   ["I also need to get","Devo anche prendere","645d7a51-1d92-4954-96a4-6d0d23a37e58","ebc6a5a3-19cf-47bd-ba04-e7504b464f1d"],
   ["some sunscreen","della crema solare","5e81547f-c90c-4e15-9072-7365fd047989","2668cd86-650e-495d-bd88-e7bdd6bdfd2d"],
   ["and some toothpaste.","e del dentifricio.","aee53ccf-1f3f-49d4-989c-96606684c866","6a2a5d5d-826d-4fa2-812c-cf0a25ae82a8"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S06": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","La crema solare è laggiù sulla sua destra,","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","2237e72d-89f5-481e-843a-a9832f394b31"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","e il dentifricio lo trova proprio dietro l'angolo.","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","26922117-2635-431c-96c5-09ae4e081526"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S07": [
   ["Thank you, you've been very helpful.","Grazie, è stato molto gentile.","73098d09-784b-4315-9ee0-5a72f5eb7497","59d47844-a3f3-4257-a695-a1c918d97578"],
   ["I'm very grateful.","Le sono molto grato.","183c9aab-6cc8-4ef7-a550-78a8a5054418","430749bb-b207-465f-841b-af4ea34dbab2"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S08": [
   ["You're welcome.","Prego.","5d55041c-5685-48c7-9859-fde2677a459f","29aeebc7-ccbd-4cd1-9c9f-6865ebe39b70"],
   ["Are you here on holiday?","È qui in vacanza?","909170cd-510c-4d58-8f30-89233fe84c43","85d8b33b-10e7-4f51-b291-dd4fca1270ae"],
   ["You speak very good English.","Parla molto bene l'inglese.","d930f751-8149-409f-995b-67eb885cda2c","cc62c383-5db6-4134-a8be-5f8aebd21c7f"]
  ],
  "eng_for_ita:pod-1:SC10-S09": [
   ["That's very kind of you!","È molto gentile da parte Sua!","c2c7822d-85f6-4eea-9869-edd3f40db30f","dc3ec95e-9fe5-4dcb-840d-18d9edc43197"],
   ["Yes, I'm on holiday,","Sì, sono in vacanza,","de432528-dcca-4ce7-83d7-9b34da210201","1e0011e8-914c-4ffb-9c92-0bede4cbcca4"],
   ["and I need to practice more","e devo esercitarmi di più","4d2b0867-925e-4aad-bb73-da9b5cae2843","1b7b44ec-ebff-4175-bf41-556a914700c8"],
   ["to speak English better.","per parlare meglio l'inglese.","a69b525a-18c7-4c5c-9fe5-feaba6e1cc9f","4aa22241-745c-49b4-89fe-5290efb5f38a"],
   ["Thank you very much, and goodbye.","Grazie mille, e arrivederci.","9dbc5c36-be61-49de-91f1-b5901009c321","c98dc312-4e3d-4df7-aec8-1fec2260e9b4"]
  ]
